OL,3,GNEWSAArrest as mural vandalised hours
OL,4,Aafter unveiling
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested for vandalising
OL,7,Fa new mural near a Wolverhampton
OL,8,Fstadium, hours after it was unveiled.
OL,10,FThe artwork, situated at the entrance
OL,11,Fof Molineux Subway, was damaged on
OL,12,FSaturday evening, said West Midlands
OL,13,FPolice.
OL,15,FThe mural was unveiled on Saturday to
OL,16,Fcelebrate 150 years of Wolverhampton
OL,17,FWanderers at Molineux Stadium.
OL,19,FAn 18-year-old man was arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of criminal damage and
OL,21,Fremains in police custody.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
